> 
> Sumary of changes:
> - Some volume bug fixes
> - SPDIF input fix.
> - Clear sample buffer after closing IEC958 stream.
> - Ring buffer fix (see my previous mail)
> - Some other misses, corrections ....

applied.  thanks for your patch!


